          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, you drive for about 1 hour to the spectacular Flamingo Lagoons and the breathtaking landscapes around them. Laguna Capitán is a stunning salt lake and nature sanctuary in the heart of the Chaco, famous for the sighting of migratory birds: flamingos and swans glide across the water in great pink and white clouds. Its saltwater also draws thousands of shorebirds and waterfowl, making it a dream spot for anyone who loves nature and birdwatching."
    },
    {
