          },
          {
            "ref": "word/document.xml#p0076",
            "textSha256": "29845230922febe11ce123283203171202e461b80797833bd5bbfc99a101698d"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "Witness the majestic panorama of the falls from Brazil’s breathtaking viewpoints. Feel the power of nature during the thrilling Macuco Boat Safari, venture deep into the spray of the waterfalls and visit the vibrant Parque das Aves to encounter the colorful birds of the Atlantic rainforest.\n\nCross into Argentina to explore the falls from above and within. Walk along jungle trails and dramatic catwalks leading to the awe-inspiring Devil’s Throat. Conclude the day at the famous Triple Frontier Landmark where Brazil, Argentina and Paraguay meet."
    },
